Create an intuitive publishing experience.

A signed-in user should be able to:

- Enter a post title.
- Write a description or body.
- Select a category.
- Add relevant tags.
- Attach one or more images.
- Add a website URL.
- Add a game URL.
- Add a GitHub repository URL.
